  "fundraiser": {
    "note": "The fundraiser display's own values (specs/002-fundraising-thermometer/contracts/display-layout.md): white and blue-light at the alphas the night ground needs, the glow, the thermometer's gradient and glows, and every cq geometry number of both arrangements. The display sizes from its stage container, so sizes are unit strings (cqh/cqw are percent of the stage's height/width). Tuning at the five-shape check is an edit here plus pnpm gen-tokens. Everything here is read only by src/ui/fundraiser.",
